# integrations/non-test-files.manifest - the exhaustive set of tracked files under integrations/
# that live at the umbrella or a backend ROOT (production impl, promoted ABI headers, shims,
# Makefile, README.md, .gitignore, and the two umbrella files). Every tracked integration file NOT at
# the exact integrations/<role>/<backend>/tests/ depth must be listed here; a new backend-root file
# fails check-old-layout (case 5) until it is declared here OR moved under the backend's tests/. That
# is the exact, name-independent ownership partition (test content lives at the exact backend tests/
# depth; every other integration file is enumerated here).
# Regenerate intentionally:
#   git ls-files 'integrations/*' | grep -vE '^integrations/(codec|http2|platform|tls)/[^/]+/tests/' | LC_ALL=C sort
